  "analysis_md": "$$\n-\\frac{1}{P}\\left(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{2y},\n$$\n\n有积分因子 $\\mu=e^{-\\int\\frac{1}{2y}\\,dy}=y^{-\\frac{1}{2}},$\n\n用 $y^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$ 乘方程可得\n\n$$\n4x^2y^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\,dx+2x^3y^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\,dy-2y^{-\\frac{1}{2}}\\,dy=d\\left(\\frac{4}{3}x^3y^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\right)-2y^{-\\frac{1}{2}}\\,dy=0,\n$$\n\n故通解为 $(x^3y-3)y^{\\frac{1}{2}}=C,$",
  "search_text": "$4x^2y^2dx+2(x^3y-1)dy=0$ 的通解为（ ） $(x^2y-3)^{1/2}=C$ $(x^3y-3)^{1/2}=C$ $(xy-3)^{1/2}=C$ $(x^4y-3)^{1/2}=C$ $$\n-\\frac{1}{P}\\left(\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}-\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{2y},\n$$\n\n有积分因子 $\\mu=e^{-\\int\\frac{1}{2y}\\,dy}=y^{-\\frac{1}{2}},$\n\n用 $y^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$ 乘方程可得\n\n$$\n4x^2y^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\,dx+2x^3y^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\,dy-2y^{-\\frac{1}{2}}\\,dy=d\\left(\\frac{4}{3}x^3y^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\right)-2y^{-\\frac{1}{2}}\\,dy=0,\n$$\n\n故通解为 $(x^3y-3)y^{\\frac{1}{2}}=C,$",
